{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"],"languages":["occ"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"@property"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"keyword","text":"nonatomic"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"readonly"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"NSArray<MLNPolygon *>","preciseIdentifier":"c:Q$objc(cs)NSArray"},{"kind":"text","text":" * "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"interiorPolygons"},{"kind":"text","text":";"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"text":"Discussion","level":2,"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The area occupied by any interior polygons is excluded from the overall shape."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Interior polygons should not overlap. An interior polygon should not have"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"interior polygons of its own."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If there are no interior polygons, the value of this property is "},{"code":"nil","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"metadata":{"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"interiorPolygons"}],"role":"symbol","title":"interiorPolygons","externalID":"c:objc(cs)MLNPolygon(py)interiorPolygons","modules":[{"name":"MapLibre"}],"roleHeading":"Instance Property","symbolKind":"property","fragments":[{"text":"interiorPolygons","kind":"identifier"}]},"abstract":[{"text":"The array of polygons nested inside the receiver.","type":"text"}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnpolygon\/interiorpolygons"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}]}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"occ","url":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNPolygon\/interiorPolygons"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/docume